  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "36",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 36"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "36",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasae ogosesenia Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Mwanyabaanto, bana oteebie ebitunwa bi’Abaisraeli: Inwe ebitunwa bi’Abaisraeli, igwa ring’ana ri’Omonene!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Ababisa baino baabasekereire, bagoteeba: Ahaa! Aase aimokererete igoro a kare ase baare gosasiimera abeire aaito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase ayio, bana oteebe ng’a aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Inwe ebitunwa, ababisa baino baabasaririe baabatigire bosa, baabamerire ase chinsemo chionsi, erinde monyare koba enibo y’ebisaku biatigarete, naende abanto babeire bakobakwana bobe na kobachaaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio inwe ebitunwa bi’Abaisraeli, igwa ring’ana ri’Omonene! Aya naro Omonene akobateebia inwe ebitunwa, na ebigoro, ne chindooche, na amakura, na amaturi, na emechie eng’anyire na gosakorwa, naende echaayire nebisaku bire ase chinsemo chionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ee, aya naro Omonene agoteeba. Ekeene, nakwanire inde nendamwamu egwoka igoro y’ebisaku bitigarete, na igoro y’Abaedomu bonsi, abwo bairire ense y’ane koba eyabo, bare ne chinkoro chigogete na ebirengererio bi’oboenenu, erinde baserie abanyene ense, na koyesakora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye bana igoro y’ense y’Abaisraeli, oteebie ebitunwa, na ebigoro, na amaranya, na amakura, ng’a aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Rora, nakwanire inde ne risemi na ekeririanda, ekiagera mwachandekire ase ogochaaywa nabaanto b’ebisaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Naimokirie okoboko kwane igoro na goteeba: Ekeene, abanto abwo b’ebisaku baabaetanaine mbachaaywe barabwo boka abanyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende inwe ebitunwa bi’Abaisraeli, mokinie chinsagia, mwame amatunda ase Abaisraeli, abanto bane, ekiagera barabwo babeire ang’e koirana inka sobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora, inche nigo inde ase ensemo yaino, nimbairanere, inwe namoremwe na kobusurwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninsangererie abanto abange bache ase more bamenyeo, ee, Abaisraeli bonsi; emechie yaino nemenywe naende, na amatombe naro naagachwe naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninsangererie goocha ase more abanto abange, ne ching’iti chinyinge. Abanto mbamentekane babuche, ne ching’iti boigo. Nintige momenye buna engaki eria ya kare, na nimbakorere amaya abuete aria amatang’ani. Erio nario moramanye ng’a inche ninche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindete Abaisraeli, abanto bane, bataare igoro yaino, mbaabaire inwe, na inwe mobe omwando obo. Timokogenderera goita abana babo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya n’aro Omonene agoteeba: Abanto nigo bagoteeba ng’a aye ense nigo okoria abanto, naende gwaitire abana b’egesaku kiao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio bono tokogenderera koria abanto, gose goita abana b’egesaku kiao. Nabo Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinkogotiga osekererwe nabaanto b’ebisaku nonya ng’ake, gose togochaaywa n’abanto. Aye togotiga egesaku kiao kegwe. Nabo Omonene ateebire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obogima oboyia bw’Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende ring’ana ri’Omonene rigaacha ase inde, riganteebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Mwanyabaanto, ekero Abaisraeli bamenyete ase ense yabo, bakayekora ekaba eyetachenegeti goetera ase chinchera chiabo na ogokora kwabo, ekiagera ogokora kwabo nigo kwabete ase obosio bwane buna ogotacheneka kw’omokuungu, ekero are nomotienyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaumora endamwamu y’ane ase bare, ekiagera baiterete amanyinga y abanto ase ense eye, na ekiagera bakorete ense ekaba eyetachenegeti ase ogosasiima emegwekano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabasiarera gochia ase egati y’ abanto b’ebisaku, bakaba besiarerete ase chinse ao ao. Nkabanachera ekiina koreng’ana norogendo rwabo, na ogokora kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende aase aande onsi bagendete ase egati y’ abanto b’ebisaku ebio, nigo bakorete erieta riane richenu rikaba eritachenegeti, na abanto bagakwana igoro yabo, bagateeba: Aba nabwo abanto ba Omonene, nonya naboigo baserigwe korwa ase ense eyio yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ngechandera erieta riane richenu erio Abaisraeli bagerete rigakorwa rikaba eritachenegeti ase egati y’ abanto b’ebisaku ebio ase bagendete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, teebia Abaisraeli ng’a aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Inwe Abaisraeli, tingokora ayio ase engencho yaino, korende nase engencho y’erieta riane richenu, erio mwakorire koba eritachenegeti ase egati y’ebisaku ebio ase mwagendete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninchene erieta riane rinene, erio riakoretwe rikaba eritachenegeti ase egati y’ abanto b’ebisaku, erieta erio inwe mwakorete rikaba eritachenegeti ase egati yabo. Ekero ndeorokie ase amaiso abo ng’a nomochenu inde ase egati yaino, erio nario abanto b’ebisaku baramanye ng’a inche ninche Omonene. Nabo Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbasangererie inwe korwa ase egati y’ abanto b’ebisaku na korwa ase chinse chionsi, erio mbarente ase ense yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbanyororokerie amaache amakenonoku, na inwe mocheneke korwa ase ogotacheneka kwaino gwonsi, na korwa ase emegwekano yaino mogosasiima. Ee, nimbachene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbae chinkoro chinyia, na mbeke omoika omoyia ime yaino; nindusie korwa ase emebere yaino chinkoro echio chire chinkong’u buna rigena, naende mbae echire chinyororo buna chinyama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbeke omoika one ime yaino, erio mbaonchore mobwatie emeroberio y’ane echiikire, morende amachiiko ane na moyakore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe momenye ase ense eyio naete chisokoro chiaino; inwe mobe abanto bane, na inche imbe Nyasae oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbatoorie korwa ase ogotacheneka kwaino gwonsi. Nimbarentere endagera, inyementekanie mono, tingotiga enchara eche ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimente amatunda ase emete, na emegondo yame chindagera chinyinge, nario abanto b’ebisaku batabaise kobasekerera ase engencho y’enchara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio moinyore chinchera chiaino chimbe, na ogokora kwaino gotarenge okuya, mwegeche inwe abanyene ase engencho y’obobe bwaino, na ogokora kwaino gw’okogechia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe Abaisraeli, tingokora amaya ayio ase engencho y’ogokora kwaino; momanye amang’ana ayio buya kegima. Inwe goika mosookigwe ase engencho y’ogokora kwaino. Nabo Omonene ateebire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Ase rituko erio ind’abe nabachenire korwa ase ebibe biaino bionsi, nindue ribaga emechie eyio emenywe, na amaagacho ayio atagoretwe aagachwe naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ense eyio yatigetwe ere bosa neremwe naende, gose abaeti tibakoyerora egendererete koba bosa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto mbateebe: “Ense eye yasaretigwe egatigwa ere bosa, bono yabeire buna omogondo o Edeni, na emechie eyio yatagoretwe egatigwa ere amaturi, bono yamenyirwe na kogiterwa chindwaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto b’ebisaku ebio biatigarete bibaetanaine ’mbamanye ng’a inche ninche Omonene naagachire aase agwo asaretigwe, naende nasimekire chimbusuro ase emegondo yatigarete ere bosa. Ninche Omonene nakwanire, goika nkore ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Ninyanchere Abaisraeli bamborie ng’a mbakorere ayio; mbabuchie babe buna amaicho ye ching’ondi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbamentekanie babe abange buna ching’ondi chichenegete chirabe echi’ebing’wanso agwo Yerusalemu, ase engaki y’Amatuko Amanene; barabwo mbaichore ase emechie yatigetwe ere amatombe. Erio nario baramanye ng’a inche ninche Omonene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
